ian Albums\"}, {\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0133-2153ce7b1a43:d07\", \"text\": \"[ 3 ] Entertainmentwise [ 4 ] Rovi [ 5 ] The album debuted at its peak position at No . 1 on the UK Charts , selling 219,662 copies in the UK that week . [ 7 ] It also spent one week at number two and two weeks at number three . One of those number-three weeks have the highest sales for that said peak for a week in the whole year of 2006 . It re-entered at number 17 at the Official UK Budget Albums Chart in November 2009 . The album also appeared in the list\"}], \"fallible_prior\": [], \"prior_explanation\": \"Uncertain; 'The Love Album' could refer to multiple works by various artists without additional context.\"}"
